      <room>AW1.126</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>BSD-Licensed Toolchain Status</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>BSD devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract></abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A number of operating system projects are currently looking at ways&#xA;to migrated from GCC and GNU binutils to BSD licensed toolchains.&#xA;This includes the BSD family of operating systems, Minix, and Apple&amp;#39;s&#xA;Mac OS.  I will discuss the current status of FreeBSD&amp;#39;s efforts to&#xA;move to an LLVM based tool chain and invite discussion on the current&#xA;state of toolchain options.  If you would like to present on your&#xA;project&amp;#39;s efforts to use emerging BSD toolchain components, please&#xA;contact brooks@FreeBSD.org.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="3021">Brooks Davis</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>